| gen_spacetime_2 on/off 贴离主线 | sp-cl-on-off；go off 硬反例 + off-others 上屏 | 164.5s | gen-spacetime-2.html ✓ | 全过 |
| gen_spacetime_3 交通工具窍门 | sp-cl-transport；身体体验讲法，边缘例外上屏 | 147.1s | gen-spacetime-3.html ✓ | 全过 |
